Types
Escher
Given maximum radius R (rad), current radius r, and exponent x, we want to find rnew:
rnew _ R * Power[r/R, x] = (1/Power[R, x-1])*Power[r2, (ex/2)]
so we can find r2 and pre-compute scl = 1/(Rx-1) and p = ex/2, so rnew _ scl*Power[r2, p]
